  "helpTitle": "Help",
  "helpContents": "Contents",
  "helpHintLearnMore": "Learn more",
  "helpHintDismiss": "Dismiss hint",
  "helpHintPrevTip": "Previous tip",
  "helpHintNextTip": "Next tip",
  "helpHintRestoreTitle": "Show help hints again",
  "helpHintRestored": "Help hints will be shown again.",
  "helpHintReserve": "Pick a day and time window, then tap a free seat to book it.",
  "helpHintReserveTopic": "Reserve hub",
  "helpHintReserveTip2": "The Week and Month views find a free half-day at a glance — tap a free cell or day to book right there.",
  "helpHintReserveTip3": "Tap the scan button and point the camera at a space's QR card — the sheet shows exactly what you may do there.",
  "helpHintReserveTip3Topic": "Scan a space code",
  "helpHintReserveTip4": "The morning, afternoon and full-day chips pick your window before you choose a seat — a booked morning counts as half a day.",
  "helpHintReserveTip4Topic": "How booking behaves",
  "helpHintReserveTip5": "Set your default booking period in Settings — the hub preselects it on every visit.",
  "helpHintReserveTip5Topic": "Settings & profile",
  "helpHintPlan": "The live floor plan: tap a free seat to book it, tap your own booking to check in.",
  "helpHintPlanTopic": "floor plan",
  "helpHintPlanTip2": "Standing at a free seat? Tap it — the sheet suggests now until closing, and confirming checks you in on the spot.",
  "helpHintPlanTip3": "Browse another moment with the date chip and the time scroller — the plan shows who sits where at any future time.",
  "helpHintPlanTip4": "Double-tap a desk, a room or the floor itself — or tap the layers icon on the level rail — to reserve the whole space at once.",
  "helpHintPlanTip5": "Tap your own seat for its sheet: check in from 15 minutes before your start, check out when you leave.",
  "helpHintPlanTip5Topic": "How booking behaves",
  "helpHintCalendar": "Browse bookings by month; tap a day to see and manage its reservations.",
  "helpHintCalendarTopic": "Calendar",
  "helpHintCalendarTip2": "The Mine / Everyone toggle shows just your bookings or the whole community's — red dots are yours, blue ones are other members'.",
  "helpHintCalendarTip3": "The shape toggle switches the lower half between the week grid and the agenda list; the floor chips filter both.",
  "helpHintCalendarTip4": "Cancelling one occurrence of a series offers \"this and following\" — checked-in and completed occurrences keep their history.",
  "helpHintCalendarTip4Topic": "How booking behaves",
  "helpHintEvents": "Everything that happened, in one feed. Decisions waiting for you sit on top; the chips filter the rest.",
  "helpHintEventsTopic": "confirmations",
  "helpHintEventsTip2": "The filter chips remember your choice across visits — and the Unread chip narrows the list to unread messages.",
  "helpHintEventsTip3": "Group the feed by type, day or member from the Group by menu; tap the group symbol to return to the flat list.",
  "helpHintEventsTip4": "Pending decisions sit pinned on top with Accept and reject — and nobody ever validates their own event.",
  "helpHintEditor": "Draw rooms and desks, stamp seats onto them — tap a seat twice to edit its properties.",
  "helpHintEditorTopic": "space editor",
  "helpHintEditorTip2": "Pick Office or Table in the toolbar and drag on the grid to draw it; Select moves and resizes what is already there.",
  "helpHintEditorTip3": "The Seat tool stamps seats onto desks; a seat's sheet sets its direction, chair type, accessories and a maintenance block.",
  "helpHintEditorTip4": "Give a seat its NFC/RFID tag from the seat sheet — tap the chip on the phone and the field fills itself.",
  "helpHintEditorTip5": "Print a QR card for every seat, desk, office and level — pick the card size and what each card shows before exporting.",
  "helpHintEditorTip5Topic": "Space QR codes",
  "helpHintAvailability": "Set the open weekdays and working hours, and add closure days nobody can book.",
  "helpHintAvailabilityTopic": "Availability",
  "helpHintAvailabilityTip2": "The booking granularity decides what a window may look like: half-days, full days, minute grids or free times.",
  "helpHintAvailabilityTip3": "Day start, half-day boundary and day end drive every half-day and full-day slot — booking, check-in and billing follow them.",
  "helpHintAvailabilityTip4": "Three booking policies tighten or relax the rules: past bookings, minute bookings kept within working hours, and admin check-out.",
  "helpHintFeatures": "Switch workspace functionality on or off — every member's app follows immediately.",
  "helpHintFeaturesTopic": "Features",
  "helpHintFeaturesTip2": "The list is hierarchical — a feature that needs another sits indented under it and greys out while its parent is off.",
  "helpHintFeaturesTip3": "Switching a parent off takes its whole subtree out of the app; the children's stored choices return untouched with the parent.",
  "helpHintFeaturesTip4": "A feature's settings entry only appears while the feature is on — the Features screen itself always stays reachable.",
  "helpHintMembers": "Invite members, set their plan percentage and role, and manage their badges.",
  "helpHintMembersTopic": "Members & plans",
  "helpHintMembersTip2": "Tap a member for their management sheet — subscription, reservation limit, badges, services and more in one place.",
  "helpHintMembersTip3": "Badges live per member: mint a printable QR badge, or register their NFC card by holding it to the device.",
  "helpHintMembersTip3Topic": "NFC badges",
  "helpHintMembersTip4": "Name admin grants admin rights after validation; the role matrix under Role management decides what every role may do.",
  "helpHintMembersTip4Topic": "Role management",
  "helpHintMoney": "Your monthly bill: browse months with the arrows; pay, export or share from here.",
  "helpHintMoneyTopic": "Money",
  "helpHintMoneyTip2": "Every document offers the same three actions: quick view on screen, download as PDF, and share to any app.",
  "helpHintMoneyTip2Topic": "Quick view, save, share",
  "helpHintMoneyTip3": "Record a payment with the date the money moved and the month it settles — the other side confirms it.",
  "helpHintMoneyTip4": "Once the month is invoiced, the invoice decides: the month reads settled as soon as its invoice is paid.",
  "helpHintMoneyTip4Topic": "the invoice decides",
  "helpHintValidation": "Decide which actions need confirmation, who confirms, and how many approvals it takes.",
  "helpHintValidationTopic": "confirmations",
  "helpHintValidationTip2": "One card per event type, each inheriting from the default rule until you edit it — payments, expenses, role changes and more.",
  "helpHintValidationTip3": "Nobody ever validates their own event, and unanswered requests expire after 7 days — nothing is granted silently.",
  "helpHintWorkspace": "Country, currency, language and billing details — documents and taxes follow these settings.",
  "helpHintWorkspaceTopic": "Workspace settings",
  "helpHintWorkspaceTip2": "Print the space QR cards from Exports — choose the card size and the info each card carries, ten per A4 page.",
  "helpHintWorkspaceTip2Topic": "Space QR codes",
  "helpHintWorkspaceTip3": "Export the space as XML to back it up or template a new one; the setup questionnaire prefills a fresh workspace end to end.",
  "helpHintWorkspaceTip4": "Reset the workspace wipes reservations, accounting and the floor plan — settings and members survive, and a typed confirmation guards it.",
  "helpHintBadges": "Issue a printable QR badge or register an NFC card; revoke lost badges any time.",
  "helpHintBadgesTopic": "NFC badges",
  "helpHintBadgesTip2": "Register a card by holding it to the device — any readable chip works, and the dialog names the workspace it joins.",
  "helpHintBadgesTip3": "Save a QR badge as PDF to print ten credit-card copies on one A4 page — spares included.",
  "helpHintBadgesTip4": "Revoke a lost badge any time; swipe a revoked badge to the right to delete it for good.",
